0 FILE 10218 - Brown House 1 Basement.ldr
0 Basement and yard foundation of the brown house on a green baseplate, with tiled floor, log-brick and slope walls, technic-pin structure, a trap door, spindled fence, hinged panels, doors and windows, plus garden and household accessories (rubbish bin, inverted dish, saucepan, life ring, skeleton leg and lightsaber hilt)
0 Name: 10218 - Brown House 1 Basement.ldr
0 Author: Stefan Frenz (smf)
